# F-06 ሥር ከስሩ ማስተካከል፦ የመስመር ማብቂያ (line ending) አንድ ዓይነት ሆኖ ይቀመጣል።
# ያለ ሕግ፣ core.autocrlf=true ሲሆን የሰራሪ (checkout) ፋይሎች CRLF ሆነው ይወጣሉ፤
# ስለዚህ FILE_MANIFEST_SHA256.txt ሃሽ ከWindows ላይ 14/14 ይሳሳታል።
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.bin binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary

# Source archive (git archive) excludes large prebuilt native/runtime binaries.
# They are build inputs shipped separately; source/ledger verification needs code + docs only.
android-app/jni/** export-ignore
android-app/ort/** export-ignore
app/models/** export-ignore
android-app/build/** export-ignore
android-app/*.apk export-ignore
android-app/*.idsig export-ignore
